# Code and useful shortcuts

// Choose a language in the header or press ⌘L inside a code block.
:::quicknote code javascript
const greeting = "Hello, Inkflit!";
console.log(greeting);
:::end

Code blocks highlight the selected language, pair brackets and quotes, and indent automatically. Choose indentation and a color theme in Settings → Edit.

⌘/ toggles comments; ⌘C copies a code block when nothing is selected. ⌘K changes the current block type.

You can remove any guide note with ⌘D. To create a fresh set later, open Settings and choose Restore Guide Notes.
